    <h2>Why exterior repaints don't last as long here</h2>
    <p>Direct Texas sun exposure breaks down exterior paint faster than in milder climates, and some Richardson neighborhoods with active HOAs, including sections of Canyon Creek, require color approval before an exterior repaint. Budget for that review step and expect a shorter repaint cycle than you might in a cooler region.</p>
