    <div class="rv-q"><h3>Do I need HOA approval to repaint my house in Richardson?</h3><p>In some neighborhoods, yes. Portions of Canyon Creek and other HOA-governed sections of Richardson require color approval before an exterior repaint, so check your HOA's architectural guidelines before signing a contract.</p></div>
